 "verdict": "include",
 "verdict_reason": "Independent-map replication: labels from map 1 scored by map 2 AUROC 0.964, reverse 0.970 (Spearman 0.58); biological replicates 0.93-0.98. Cross-study K562 vs horlbeck2018: their score for our labels 0.797 (46 pos), our score for their labels 0.843 (75 pos); vs simpson2023 0.95/0.97 (165/170 pos) but same lab lineage, so partly non-independent. Hit rate 1.79% plausible; fitness-only AUROC 0.66 (screen singles) / 0.55 (DepMap), below 0.8. Caveat: CRISPRi knockdown is hypomorphic; library is DDR/essential-gene focused (313 genes, not the paper's 293 because the drug maps are not used for gene intersection)."
}